{"asset_key":"ep4/env_story_14301022","episode":"ep4","category":"env_story","story_id":"14301022","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1430102201:1":{"text":"괜찮아! 촌장이 분명히 새로운 칠면조 다리를 준비하라고 시킬 테니까!","source_cn":"不会的！村长肯定会让人再准备一盘新火鸡腿的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57081FDBF49D2B1E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1430102202:1":{"text":"게다가 그런 대단한 분들은 세상에서 제일 맛있는 음식 다 먹어봤을 텐데, 칠면조 다리 하나쯤이야 신경도 안 쓸걸?","source_cn":"而且那些大人物一定吃过更多好吃的，不会在意区区一盘火鸡腿的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDFE183BFAF1777AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1430102203:1":{"text":"하지만 이 칠면조 다리도 이렇게 맛있는데, 이것보다 더 맛있는 음식은 대체 무슨 맛일까...","source_cn":"不过火鸡腿已经这么好吃了，比它还美味的食物得是什么味道啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3C93CC88DF100C87","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:格罗姆":{"text":"그롬","source":"格罗姆","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}